    "enUS": {
      "description": "On the corpse of the fallen wight, you find a crystal that is faintly radiating necrotic energy.",
      "dialogue": {
        "6718d7838dcd868f89bd": "You say this was taken from a wight attacking the city?$b$bWe have received word about the necropolis base camps that are being summoned by the Scourge. I suspect they were trying to create one in the Undercity. We will have to be vigilant in the future.",
        "c738890716dc7b0d9b32": "Can I help you with something?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Faint Necrotic Crystal to Lieutenant Rukag in the courtyard of the Undercity.",
      "title": "Faint Necrotic Crystal",
